uidance wording was unavailable; no independent transfer established. The SKILL generation-workspace path differs from the mounted path; effect on behavior is unknown."},\n    {"condition":"A3","source_policy":"Six exploration-guided development trajectories plus common inputs; no complete GT.","methods":["camera_projection","hinge_edge_candidates","sampled_vertical_support","world_aabb","directional_noise_material"],"implementation_examples":["spatial.project_points","spatial.hinge_positions","support.world_bounds","support.sample_support","appearance.directional_stone"],"evidence":["/evidence/A3/learning/research_evidence.json","/evidence/A3/public_library/spatial.py:7-29"],"provenance_note":"The report describes historical comparisons and selections, not proven transfer. Hinge candidates compute positions, not assembly transformations. An attempted historical contact sheet failed because Pillow was unavailable."},\n    {"condition":"A4","source_policy":"Three complete development GT scenes and common inputs; no historical student trajectories.","methods":["camera_projection","landmark_residual","camera_aim","hinge_transform","aabb_support_screen","scene_graph_relations","directional_noise_material"],"implementation_examples":["project_points","landmark_error","aim_camera","hinge_pose","make_directional_material","support_bounds","assembly_components"],"evidence":["/evidence/A4/learning/research_evidence.json","/evidence/A4/public_library/reconstruction.py:8-118"],"provenance_note":"Reported direct GT queries contextualize methods alongside general geometry and shader knowledge; stored GT observations are not student outcomes. Synthetic tests do not establish image improvement. Validation observed displacement of parented components, so pivot preservation is not proof of a coherent assembly."},\n    {"condition":"A5","source_policy":"The same three complete development GT scenes as A4 plus the same six exploration trajectories as A3.","methods":["camera_projection